      "pinnedBy": null,
      "body": "Hi! I created a PR to attempt to remedy this. The return points in the `configure_controller` function that had to with chainable controllers weren't cleaning up the controller (ie transitioning it back to UNCONFIGURED from INACTIVE) during early returns.\n\nI added calls to `cleanup_controller` for both the case where the chainable controller has no interfaces and the case where exporting the interfaces raises an exception.",
      "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi! I created a PR to attempt to remedy this. The return points in the <code class=\"notranslate\">configure_controller</code> function that had to with chainable controllers weren't cleaning up the controller (ie transitioning it back to UNCONFIGURED from INACTIVE) during early returns.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I added calls to <code class=\"notranslate\">cleanup_controller</code> for both the case where the chainable controller has no interfaces and the case where exporting the interfaces raises an exception.</p>",
